      "start_seconds": 312.61,
      "end_seconds": 329.83,
      "duration_seconds": 17.22,
      "text": "fibre, plenty of water, and don't sit on the toilet for long. Do get help quickly if the bleeding gets heavier or you feel faint. I'd like you back in four weeks. Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
